        <mxCell id="7" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-top:4px;text-align:center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Crowd Move&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;/&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;+ positioning strategy : Relative Positioning, Optimal Spread Positioning&lt;br/&gt;+ target crowd members : Crowd, Roster Entry&lt;br/&gt;+ issue movement commands : Movement Execution&lt;br/&gt;+ apply facing after move : Facing Destination, Gang Leader Facing, Gang Mode&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;/&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
